{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩押的難民逃到猶大"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你們當將羊羔奉給那地掌權的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從西拉往曠野，送到錫安城","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"的山。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的居民","poem":1},{"noteId":16},{"text":"在亞嫩渡口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必像遊飛的鳥，如拆窩的雛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你獻謀略，行公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的影子在午間如黑夜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隱藏被趕散的人，不可顯露逃民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你容我這被趕散的人和你同居。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於摩押，求你作他的隱密處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脫離滅命者的面。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勒索人的歸於無有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅的事止息了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺壓人的從國中除滅了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有寶座因慈愛堅立；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有一位誠誠實實坐在其上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大衛帳幕中施行審判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋求公平，速行公義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我們聽說摩押人驕傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是極其驕傲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽說他狂妄、驕傲、忿怒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他誇大的話是虛空的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，摩押人必為摩押哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都要哀號。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們摩押人要為吉珥‧哈列設的葡萄餅哀歎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"極其憂傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"因為希實本的田地","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和西比瑪的葡萄樹都衰殘了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的君主折斷其上美好的枝子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這枝子長到雅謝延到曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嫩枝向外探出，直探過鹽海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要為西比瑪的葡萄樹哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與雅謝人哀哭一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希實本、以利亞利啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要以眼淚澆灌你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為有交戰吶喊的聲音","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臨到你夏天的果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並你收割的莊稼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從肥美的田中奪去了歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在葡萄園裏必無歌唱，也無歡呼的聲音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹酒的在酒醡中不得踹出酒來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他歡呼的聲音止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我心腹為摩押哀鳴如琴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心腸為吉珥‧哈列設也是如此。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["摩押人朝見的時候，在高處疲乏，又到他聖所祈禱，也不蒙應允。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["這是耶和華從前論摩押的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但現在耶和華說：「三年之內，照雇工的年數，摩押的榮耀與他的群眾必被藐視，餘剩的人甚少無幾。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":1}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}